.TH AUDIO_PLAY 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
audio_play \- Play a sound once at gain 0..1 on a free channel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqaudio.h\(dq
.BI "void audio_play(const Sound *s, float gain);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Play a sound once at gain 0..1 on a free channel. Dropped silently if every channel is busy.
.SH MODULE
audio (src/engine/audio/audio.h)
